    "required_age": 0,
    "is_free": false,
    "detailed_description": "<h1>Visit our website!</h1><p><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1157900/extras/11b4053d850b6664d42761c2e8aa16e5.avif?t=1742964878\" /></div><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1157900/extras/069c4ce16031b03910a599678eeba76b.avif?t=1742964878\" /></div><br><strong>Visit our website!</strong> to join our Discord server and our <strong>Mailing List</strong> for a chance to become an Alpha &amp; Beta tester! <i>Link on the right side of this page</i></p><br><h1>About the Game</h1><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1157900/extras/232d4b94bb7c6050dab82d0f0457cc2e.avif?t=1742964878\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong><i>Ten Thousand Coins: The Golden Merchant</i></strong> is a story-rich strategy trading game where, as a young fox merchant, the mysterious fate of your lost mentor relies on your mastery of bartering, earning coins, and surviving the danger-ridden wilderness. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1157900/extras/e24186b0a5d9b32c70641d5b66d26948.poster.avif?t=1742964878\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1157900/extras/e24186b0a5d9b32c70641d5b66d26948.webm?t=1742964878\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1157900/extras/e24186b0a5d9b32c70641d5b66d26948.mp4?t=1742964878\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Many years prior, while a Ravenn merchant trades in this war-ravaged land, he makes a shocking discovery and finds a mysterious little companion. His actions will determine the fate of those a decade later.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1157900/extras/8e6ff82ba797850bccb2789a042c1977.webp?t=1742964878\" /></div>Discover deep character-driven stories spanning two timelines. See your character decisions come to fruition between timelines. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1157900/extras/b52d94e331401f0f4e65019f3f50274c.poster.avif?t=1742964878\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1157900/extras/b52d94e331401f0f4e65019f3f50274c.webm?t=1742964878\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1157900/extras/b52d94e331401f0f4e65019f3f50274c.mp4?t=1742964878\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1157900/extras/57fefad9a2a037693854286c026b9a8e.webp?t=1742964878\" /></div>Enjoy turn-based merchant trading with time &amp; resource management and bartering goods directly with traders while balancing their moods and needs. Knowing what goods, and when to offer them is the key to a successful trade. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1157900/extras/b7879cce524bbce88e746525c06b8ad2.poster.avif?t=1742964878\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1157900/extras/b7879cce524bbce88e746525c06b8ad2.webm?t=1742964878\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1157900/extras/b7879cce524bbce88e746525c06b8ad2.mp4?t=1742964878\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1157900/extras/34bbbe99f8246a43d991bbcae26475d4.avif?t=1742964878\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">In our Company Mode, play as a masked merchant of the Ravenn Company where you will rebuild a company building back to its former glory in this RPG and rogue-lite game mode.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1157900/extras/830bad54c460fb957feb1d7a0ce06198.poster.avif?t=1742964878\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1157900/extras/830bad54c460fb957feb1d7a0ce06198.webm?t=1742964878\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1157900/extras/830bad54c460fb957feb1d7a0ce06198.mp4?t=1742964878\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1157900/extras/d421c56b329789db682c3fc4f7d93b6e.webp?t=1742964878\" /></div>Bandits and wild beasts are constantly eyeing your wagons. Experience turn-based combat with a merchant twist: each of your trading goods can be used for attacking or defending with its own unique effects. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1157900/extras/626a882fbc1dd5b6a2484c329f705cf5.poster.avif?t=1742964878\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1157900/extras/626a882fbc1dd5b6a2484c329f705cf5.webm?t=1742964878\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1157900/extras/626a882fbc1dd5b6a2484c329f705cf5.mp4?t=1742964878\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Alternatively, for a peaceful resolution, negotiate or intimidate your way out of a fight! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1157900/extras/f3ccfab92cf0012260631681f6186f1a.webp?t=1742964878\" /></div></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Story Mode - An immersive and character-focused storyline spanning two timelines. Make impactful choices to craft your journey to the end. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Company Mode - Play as a masked merchant of the Ravenn Company and rebuild a rundown company building back to its former glory. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">A crisp fully hand-drawn anime-inspired art style. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Colourful characters, cities and settlements to explore, trade, and build a reputation with. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Hundreds of unique goods to discover, use, and trade with. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Hire and assemble various guards &amp; travellers and build your merchant convoy to aid you on your travels. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Random wilderness encounters to navigate through and challenging enemies to battle against. </p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1157900/extras/ae3ecd7432c8ef4c07e3848ba74b2c60.webp?t=1742964878\" /></div></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1157900/extras/232d4b94bb7c6050dab82d0f0457cc2e.avif?t=1742964878\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong><i>Ten Thousand Coins: The Golden Merchant</i></strong> is a story-rich strategy trading game where, as a young fox merchant, the mysterious fate of your lost mentor relies on your mastery of bartering, earning coins, and surviving the danger-ridden wilderness. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1157900/extras/e24186b0a5d9b32c70641d5b66d26948.poster.avif?t=1742964878\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1157900/extras/e24186b0a5d9b32c70641d5b66d26948.webm?t=1742964878\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1157900/extras/e24186b0a5d9b32c70641d5b66d26948.mp4?t=1742964878\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Many years prior, while a Ravenn merchant trades in this war-ravaged land, he makes a shocking discovery and finds a mysterious little companion. His actions will determine the fate of those a decade later.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1157900/extras/8e6ff82ba797850bccb2789a042c1977.webp?t=1742964878\" /></div>Discover deep character-driven stories spanning two timelines. See your character decisions come to fruition between timelines. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.stea