ogue-lite game mode.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1157900/extras/830bad54c460fb957feb1d7a0ce06198.poster.avif?t=1742964878\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1157900/extras/830bad54c460fb957feb1d7a0ce06198.webm?t=1742964878\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1157900/extras/830bad54c460fb957feb1d7a0ce06198.mp4?t=1742964878\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1157900/extras/d421c56b329789db682c3fc4f7d93b6e.webp?t=1742964878\" /></div>Bandits and wild beasts are constantly eyeing your wagons. Experience turn-based combat with a merchant twist: each of your trading goods can be used for attacking or defending with its own unique effects. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1157900/extras/626a882fbc1dd5b6a2484c329f705cf5.poster.avif?t=1742964878\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1157900/extras/626a882fbc1dd5b6a2484c329f705cf5.webm?t=1742964878\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1157900/extras/626a882fbc1dd5b6a2484c329f705cf5.mp4?t=1742964878\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Alternatively, for a peaceful resolution, negotiate or intimidate your way out of a fight! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1157900/extras/f3ccfab92cf0012260631681f6186f1a.webp?t=1742964878\" /></div></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Story Mode - An immersive and character-focused storyline spanning two timelines. Make impactful choices to craft your journey to the end. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Company Mode - Play as a masked merchant of the Ravenn Company and rebuild a rundown company building back to its former glory. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">A crisp fully hand-drawn anime-inspired art style. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Colourful characters, cities and settlements to explore, trade, and build a reputation with. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Hundreds of unique goods to discover, use, and trade with. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Hire and assemble various guards &amp; travellers and build your merchant convoy to aid you on your travels. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Random wilderness encounters to navigate through and challenging enemies to battle against. </p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1157900/extras/ae3ecd7432c8ef4c07e3848ba74b2c60.webp?t=1742964878\" /></div></p>",
